_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🔴 Critical_

**Reset `_isLoading` on all exit paths**

`_isLoading` is set to `true` before the async work and only reset at the very end. If any exception is thrown (e.g. invalid config entry, network error from `getAccounts`), the method exits early with `_isLoading === true` and `this.mapping === null`. Subsequent calls immediately return because the guard sees `_isLoading`, so the map can never be populated for the rest of the process. Please wrap the body in a `try/finally` (or similar) so `_isLoading` is cleared on every code path. 

```diff
