**Fix timeout race: orphaned rejecting promise can trigger unhandled rejection (process exit on Node ≥15).**

Using Promise.race with a rejecting timeout that isn’t cleared leaves a pending promise that later rejects without a handler. Replace with a cancellable wrapper that clears the timer on settle.


Apply this diff:

```diff
