In src/utils/ActualApi.ts around lines 123-128, the Promise.race approach leaves
the timeout's rejecting promise orphaned and can cause unhandled rejections;
replace the race with a cancellable wrapper that clears the timer when the
operation settles: create a new Promise that starts a timeout (const timer =
